HORIZON 247 — data licenses
===========================
The code license (LICENSE) does NOT apply to data. Each dataset keeps its own terms.
Derived data (bundles) must carry the license of the source they derive from.

* Mars dust optical depth (Montabone et al., Mars Climate Database):
  Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0).
  Any adaptation of this data (including our bundles) must keep CC BY-SA 3.0
  and credit the authors. It cannot be "all rights reserved".
* NASA data (GISTEMP, GPM IMERG, MODIS, ...): NASA open-data policy; cite each product
  and version (see packages/zon/src/zon/layers/*.yaml and NOTICE).
* Natural Earth boundaries: public domain (verify before publishing).
* Simulated data: generated by this project; always labeled "simulated".

Status: DRAFT. Not legal advice. Verify every dataset's terms before publishing.
